  "details": "Would be great to be make better use of the new expression menu on desktop for example for Radial Puppet be allowed to use the mouse's scroll wheel(Maybe with smoothing and acceleration) to adjust it as well and still keep the option to use the mouse movement as well as a joystick, would be nice to be able to use the scroll wheel to scroll between buttons as well and maybe only use mouse control for something that requires some directionality (Like two or 4 axis Puppet) so you still are able to maintain the ability to look around in desktop when the menu is open unless you're in those menus.\nAnd also maybe keep the option to use only the mouse if some people prefer it for being able to switch between values more quickly.",
